<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Oct trade balance to be announced today.</title>
<headline>Brazil Oct trade balance to be announced today.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Ministry of Industry and Commerce will reveal the nervously-awaited trade balance for October at 1500 local/1700 GMT Thursday, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The ministry had originally intended to hold off announcing the result for the month, expected by some analysts to be a deficit of $1.0 billion, until next week.</p>
<p>The spokeswoman gave no reason for the change.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358</p>
